3. **Figure 3 (Vortex/FTLE diagnostics):** Plots the Q-criterion autocorrelation to show the decorrelation time of trapping events, the distribution of Finite-Time Lyapunov Exponents (FTLE) at the final time, a bar chart comparing the mean FTLE of 'Trapped' vs 'Free' cohorts, and a 3D spatial visualization of a subset of tracer trajectories overlaid with high Q-criterion regions (top 1%) for the final snapshot. The high Q-criterion regions are visualized using a scatter plot of grid points where Q exceeds the 99th percentile.

All plots are saved at high resolution (300 dpi) in the `data/` directory with descriptive filenames and timestamps. The script also prints a summary of the plotted data to the console.

