- Removed the duplicate save of Figure 1.
- Added the visualization of high Q-criterion regions (vortex structures) to the 3D spatial visualization in Figure 3. This is done by loading the final snapshot VTK file, computing the Q-criterion field, and plotting a scatter of grid points where Q exceeds the 99th percentile.
